/*
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  File:        midi2_resources.cpp.template

  Description: Example product Property Exchange resources for the MIDI_CPP
  UMP_Endpoint. TEMPLATE: copy into your application, remove ".template", and
  replace the example struct/table with your own product parameters.

  Two resource forms are shown:
    1. Declarative field table (preferred). Map JSON keys straight onto your
       backing variables; the engine auto-serialises Get, auto-applies Set, and
       auto-derives the JSON Schema for the ResourceList. A property name is
       written exactly once. Optional onApplied(ctx) fires once per Set for
       side-effects (recompute, LEDs, persistence).
    2. Escape hatch (get/set callbacks) for irregular/computed resources that
       don't fit a flat field table.

